{
  "id": "story-land",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "requires": ["story"],
  "meta": {
    "title": "Act 1 — Land: Embervale",
    "note": "The five main quests of Act 1 (game-story.md §4, issue #143). Ordering is `prerequisites` and nothing else: `arc` is a journal heading, array order means nothing, and no counter anywhere says which act the player is in — the act boundary is the flags `sea-revealed` and `act-1-complete` that the last quest sets.",
    "what-corrupted-means": "`quest:land/the-mill-road` culls the three enemies that have no `capture` block — Gloopling, Snortle and Peckit. A `wild-…` enemy is a beast you are meant to BOND, so a cull that counted one would be the game asking for the opposite of what it just taught. Named as a list rather than derived, because the trigger filter takes ids and because an enemy added later should have to opt IN to being something the story asks you to put down.",
    "towns-stay-in-core": "Act 1 adds no towns. `town:encampment`, `town:redbriar` and `town:stonewatch` ship in core and are referenced from here — the road planner routes one trunk and two spurs, so those three are the ground settlements the world has (game-story.md §1 rule 4)."
  },
